    caveat:openAlexId "T13446" ;
    skos:exactMatch <https://openalex.org/T13446> ;
    skos:scopeNote "This cluster of papers explores the effects of chronic systemic exposure to D-galactose on aging, neurodegeneration, oxidative damage, and cognitive impairment in animal models. The protective effects of various natural compounds, including R-a-lipoic acid, ursolic acid, melatonin, and troxerutin, are also investigated. The role of Portulaca oleracea (purslane) in ameliorating the detrimental effects of D-galactose is a recurring theme in the research."@en ;
    caveat:openAlexKeyword "Aging"@en, "Antioxidant"@en, "Cognitive Dysfunction"@en, "D-Galactose"@en, "Inflammation"@en, "Memory Impairment"@en, "Neurodegeneration"@en, "Neuroprotective Effects"@en, "Oxidative Stress"@en, "Portulaca Oleracea"@en ;
